                "title": "Nova Tech Phantom Equity Design",
                "v": "Nova Tech: 140 employees, Series C, post-money valuation $48M. Five executives to be included in the phantom equity plan. The board wants to grant each executive a defined percentage interest in the company's enterprise value growth — rewarding the growth from current valuation to eventual exit. Vesting: 4-year time-based (25% per year). Settlement: cash payment at a qualifying exit event (IPO, trade sale, or company decision to liquidate the plan)."
