                "v": "Individual conversations first, then team disclosure — for two reasons: (1) each rep's reaction will be personal and based on their own prior year experience; a rep who missed target by 5% in an established territory will interpret a similar quota differently from a rep who exceeded target in a developing territory; (2) a rep who feels their quota is unfair deserves the opportunity to raise it privately before it becomes a group dynamic. The individual conversation should cover: how the quota was set (the methodology), why their specific territory quota is at the level it is, what the company aggregate target is, and what achieving target means for their TTC. Each conversation should include the plan document and the payout table at different attainment levels."
