                "v": "<strong>Inside Sales commission structure:</strong>\nThreshold: 75% of quota (below this, no commission)\nStandard rate: applies from threshold to 100% of quota, on commissionable revenue above threshold\nAccelerator: 1.5x standard rate on revenue above 100% of quota\nCap: 200% of TVC — rolling quarterly (Q1-Q4 each cap separately)\n\n<strong>Account Executive commission structure:</strong>\nThreshold: 70% of quota (enterprise deals are lumpier — lower threshold preserves motivation through difficult pipelines)\nStandard rate: applies threshold to 100% on commissionable revenue\nAccelerator: 2.0x standard rate above 100% (higher leverage for enterprise to reward difficult multi-stakeholder deal wins)\nCap: 250% of TVC — annual cap (enterprise deals are fewer and larger — quarterly cap creates perverse timing incentives for large deals)"
