                "v": "Palora Health is sending its Head of Finance from Lagos to Nairobi for a 24-month long-term assignment. The Head of Finance earns NGN 28M annually, has two school-age children, and currently pays NGN 650K/month in rent in Lagos. The Head of Total Rewards must design the assignment package using the balance sheet approach."
